## 5. 📊 Evaluation & Candidate Scoring (Threshold 100)

### Score Breakdown

| Parameter | Max Marks |
| --- | --- |
| Task Quality | **25** |
| Deadline Adherence | **20** |
| Instructions Followed | **15** |
| Communication | **10** |
| Problem Solving | **10** |
| Learning Ability | **10** |
| AI / Tool Usage | **5** |
| Documentation | **5** |
| **TOTAL** | **100** |

### Decision Matrix

$$\begin{array}{cl} \mathbf{\ge 80} & \longrightarrow \text{Strong Candidate (Probation / Core Offer)} \\ \mathbf{65 - 79} & \longrightarrow \text{Developing Talent / Extended Paid Tests} \\ \mathbf{50 - 64} & \longrightarrow \text{Project Basis Only} \\ \mathbf{< 50} & \longrightarrow \text{Reject} \end{array}$$

